[2.25, "o", "# Improve Operator Signal And Documentation Experience - Charter\r\n\r\n## Goals\r\n\r\n| ID | Description | Verification |\r\n|----|-------------|--------------|\r\n| MG-01 | Complete epic `VDaiFfFPe` so Port has one concise mission-verification entrypoint, a simplified `just` surface, and foundational documentation that is fast to audit. | board: VDaiFfFPe |\r\n| MG-02 | Leave the repository in a doctor-clean state with mission progress legible through `just mission` and linked board artifacts. | manual: run `just mission` and `just doctor` |\r\n\r\n## Constraints\r\n\r\n- Keep `nix develop -c just doctor` clean after structural board changes.\r\n- Use `port` as the canonical user-facing command in docs and help; do not publish `cargo run -p port-cli` in user-facing examples.\r\n- Keep default help surfaces concise: root `just` help should emphasize common workflows, and `port --help` should keep only a small set of high-value examples.\r\n- Preserve access to lower-level or demo recipes without surfacing them in the default top-level help.\r\n\r\n## Halting Rules\r\n\r\n- DO NOT halt while epic `VDaiFfFPe` still has actionable planning or delivery work that can be progressed from local context.\r\n- HALT when `board: VDaiFfFPe` is satisfied and only manual verification remains.\r\n- YIELD to human when progress depends on external release infrastructure, unavailable credentials, or subjective documentation direction that cannot be inferred from local context.\r\n"]
[3.6, "o", "$ keel epic show VDaiFfFPe\r\n"]
[4.05, "o", "Title:     \u001b[1mOperator Signal And Documentation Foundations\u001b[0m\r\nStatus:    \u001b[32mdone\u001b[39m\r\nCreated:   \u001b[2m2026-03-11 13:05:24\u001b[0m\r\nStarted:   \u001b[2m2026-03-11 13:09:32\u001b[0m\r\nUpdated:   \u001b[2m2026-03-11 13:53:14\u001b[0m\r\nCompleted: \u001b[2m2026-03-11 13:53:14\u001b[0m (\u001b[2m43m\u001b[0m)\r\nPath:      \u001b[2m/home/alex/workspace/spoke-sh/port/.keel/epics/VDaiFfFPe/README.md\u001b[0m\r\nPRD:       \u001b[2m/home/alex/workspace/spoke-sh/port/.keel/epics/VDaiFfFPe/PRD.md\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1mProblem\u001b[0m\r\n  Port exposes real delivery progress, but the signal is hard to audit quickly:\r\n  ...\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mGoals\u001b[0m\r\n  - \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-01\u001b[0m: Give maintainers one concise mission verification surface. (\u001b[38;2;230;237;243;48;2;48;54;61mjust mission\u001b[0m shows a compact board-backed report and a high-level artifact gallery -> First voyage complete)\r\n  - \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-02\u001b[0m: Make the repo's primary docs auditable from the root. (Root documentation covers constitution, architecture, configuration, release, and evaluation expectations -> First voyage complete)\r\n  - \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-03\u001b[0m: Reduce help-surface noise without losing discoverability. (Root \u001b[38;2;230;237;243;48;2;48;54;61mjust\u001b[0m help and \u001b[38;2;230;237;243;48;2;48;54;61mport --help\u001b[0m keep only common workflows and 2-3 high-value examples -> First voyage complete)\r\n  - \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-04\u001b[0m: Publish one canonical operator vocabulary. (User-facing examples use \u001b[38;2;230;237;243;48;2;48;54;61mport\u001b[0m and point detailed flows to \u001b[38;2;230;237;243;48;2;48;54;61mCONFIGURATION.md\u001b[0m and focused docs -> First voyage complete)\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mScope Drift\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m(no scope drift detected)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mStructural Drift\u001b[0m\r\n  Coefficient: 0.63 (severe)\r\n  Coverage:    entities 302/302 | knowledge 5/43 | source 0/0 | docs 0/17\r\n  Context:     38 knowledge units lack source provenance; 17 project docs are unlinked\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mRequirement Coverage\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[36mFR-01\u001b[39m - Port must provide a single \u001b[38;2;230;237;243;48;2;48;54;61mjust mission\u001b[0m mission report path that presents a concise board-backed report plus a high-level artifact gallery.\r\n    Linked goals (2): \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-01\u001b[0m, \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-03\u001b[0m\r\n    Linked children (1): \u001b[1m\u001b[35mVDaiL5HDr\u001b[39m\u001b[0m/\u001b[36mSRS-01\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[36mFR-02\u001b[39m - The repository must reorganize \u001b[38;2;230;237;243;48;2;48;54;61mjust\u001b[0m into logical modules and keep the default top-level help focused on common workflows.\r\n    Linked goals (2): \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-01\u001b[0m, \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-03\u001b[0m\r\n    Linked children (1): \u001b[1m\u001b[35mVDaiL5HDr\u001b[39m\u001b[0m/\u001b[36mSRS-02\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[36mFR-03\u001b[39m - Port must publish root-level foundational docs covering constitution, architecture, configuration, release, and evaluation expectations.\r\n    Linked goals (2): \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-02\u001b[0m, \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-04\u001b[0m\r\n    Linked children (1): \u001b[1m\u001b[35mVDaiL5HDr\u001b[39m\u001b[0m/\u001b[36mSRS-03\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[36mFR-04\u001b[39m - Port must simplify the top-level CLI and README examples to a small set of useful entry examples and move detailed configuration workflows into \u001b[38;2;230;237;243;48;2;48;54;61mCONFIGURATION.md\u001b[0m.\r\n    Linked goals (3): \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-02\u001b[0m, \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-03\u001b[0m, \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-04\u001b[0m\r\n    Linked children (1): \u001b[1m\u001b[35mVDaiL5HDr\u001b[39m\u001b[0m/\u001b[36mSRS-04\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[36mFR-05\u001b[39m - User-facing docs and help must use the canonical \u001b[38;2;230;237;243;48;2;48;54;61mport\u001b[0m command surface instead of \u001b[38;2;230;237;243;48;2;48;54;61mcargo run -p port-cli\u001b[0m.\r\n    Linked goals (1): \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-04\u001b[0m\r\n    Linked children (1): \u001b[1m\u001b[35mVDaiL5HDr\u001b[39m\u001b[0m/\u001b[36mSRS-05\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[36mNFR-01\u001b[39m - Mission verification output must be derived from board truth and not require hand-maintained summary text.\r\n    Linked goals (2): \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-01\u001b[0m, \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-03\u001b[0m\r\n    Linked children (1): \u001b[1m\u001b[35mVDaiL5HDr\u001b[39m\u001b[0m/\u001b[36mSRS-NFR-01\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[36mNFR-02\u001b[39m - Documentation simplification must reduce duplication by linking to canonical root docs instead of copying long example blocks into multiple places.\r\n    Linked goals (3): \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-02\u001b[0m, \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-03\u001b[0m, \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-04\u001b[0m\r\n    Linked children (1): \u001b[1m\u001b[35mVDaiL5HDr\u001b[39m\u001b[0m/\u001b[36mSRS-NFR-02\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[36mNFR-03\u001b[39m - The first voyage must finish with board-linked implementation stories and concrete proof commands rather than another documentation-only placeholder.\r\n    Linked goals (4): \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-01\u001b[0m, \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-02\u001b[0m, \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-03\u001b[0m, \u001b[38;2;255;244;214;48;2;112;80;0;1mGOAL-04\u001b[0m\r\n    Linked children (1): \u001b[1m\u001b[35mVDaiL5HDr\u001b[39m\u001b[0m/\u001b[36mSRS-NFR-03\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mPress Release\u001b[0m\r\n  Status:     \u001b[2mnot authored\u001b[0m\r\n  Guidance:   optional; use for large user-facing value shifts\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mProgress\u001b[0m\r\n  Voyages:              1/1 \u001b[32m\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u001b[39m \u001b[32m1/1\u001b[39m\r\n  Stories:              2/2 \u001b[32m\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u001b[39m \u001b[32m2/2\u001b[39m\r\n  ETA:                  complete\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mVerification Strategy\u001b[0m\r\n  Techniques:\r\n    - Area: Method\r\n    - CLI help simplification: automated help test + command proof\r\n    - Cargo-runner removal: search proof\r\n    - Mission verification path: command proof + inspection\r\n    - Root documentation: inspection + doc audit\r\n    - \u001b[38;2;230;237;243;48;2;48;54;61mjust\u001b[0m help simplification: command proof\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mVerification Readiness\u001b[0m\r\n  Criteria:              automated 12 | manual 0\r\n  Requirement coverage:  automated 6 | manual 0\r\n  Artifact inventory:    text 6 | media 0 | other 0\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mVoyages\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[35mVDaiL5HDr\u001b[39m\u001b[0m - Mission Verification And Help Simplification (\u001b[32mdone\u001b[39m)\r\n"]
